  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUNERGY. Job creation  through solar mini-grids Kenya and Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement is under Norad&apos;s Enterprise for Development Scheme. The project includes feasibility studies for minigrids and larger stand-alone systems, training of employees and customers as well as a pilot targeting 200-300 households. The project will contribute to rural electrification from solar energy in Kenya and Uganda. The stand-alone systems will be of the order of 0.5 MW aimed at, among other things, drying processes on coffee and tea plantations (Commercial and Industrial) and hospitals).</narrative>
  </description>
